  << /ActualText (\054 with version 2\0561 being the latest and final release of the specification\056 The higher the version number\054 the more APIs are supported\056\n\nHowever\054 \056NET Standard is not relevant anymore for modern \056NET development\056\nBeginning with \056NET 5 and the unification of \056NET\054 we have a different philosophy and do not need \056NET Standard anymore\056\240\n\050A class library targeting \056NET 5 or higher can be shared across all modern \056NET application types\056)
